# Agreement Duration Calculation

This scope calculates the duration between the conclusion date and the signing date of the food aid agreement.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementTimeline:
  input conclusion_date content date
  input signing_date content date
  output signing_duration content duration
```

## Agreement Timeline

The duration between the conclusion date and the signing date.

```catala
scope AgreementTimeline:
  date round down
  definition signing_duration equals signing_date - conclusion_date
```